body":"Because the string does not exist in the translations yet, you need to add it if you want to test it. Here's a quick hack (run with EditorScript or whatever):\r\n```GDScript\r\n\tvar translation := Translation.new()\r\n\ttranslation.locale = \"pl\" # Replace with your tested locale.\r\n\ttranslation.add_plural_message(\"%d step\", [\"%d krok\", \"%d kroki\", \"%d kroków\"])\r\n\tvar domain := TranslationServer.get_or_add_domain(\"godot.editor\")\r\n\tdomain.add_translation(translation)\r\n```\r\nAlternatively, you can just test with a project's translation.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5500722013/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5500997194","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107205#issuecomment-5500997194","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107205","id":5500997194,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABR-KOSg","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"ht